      "content": "SP 80 SE              THE LEE              THE LEE                                             (south side) 4/97                                       Church Cottage - -                                          II Small house.  1696, C18 and C20.  Brick.  Timber-framed east gable. Old tile roof, half-hipped to east.  Three bays with C17 brick stack between east bays.  Modern west bay with outshot.  One-and-a-half storey. Casements with flared headers and band course.  Date brick below tiebeam 1696. Listing NGR: SP8992404314"
    }
